# Flutter app architecture (Xyvin / 24-connect pattern)

This project (`driveforme_user`) follows the same conventions as **24-connect-app**.

## Layout

- `lib/main.dart` — bootstrap only (`WidgetsBinding` when needed, optional Firebase/dotenv, `runApp`).
- `lib/src/data/` — models, providers, services, router, constants, utils (no feature widgets).
- `lib/src/interfaces/` — all `Widget` code: `onboarding/`, `main_pages/<feature>/`, `components/`.

Imports: `package:driveforme_user/...` (paths under `lib/`).

## State (Riverpod 3)

- Prefer `riverpod_annotation` + `part '*.g.dart'` + `build_runner` when adding generated providers (add deps to match 24-connect if you adopt codegen).
- Shared HTTP: one `ApiProvider` + `@riverpod` factory; `BASE_URL` / `API_KEY` from dotenv; Bearer via `AuthProvider` / secure storage when you add APIs.
- Feature APIs: small `*Api` classes; inject `apiProviderProvider`.
- Async domain: `@Riverpod(keepAlive: true) class X extends _$X` with `Future<T> build()`; parse responses into models; optional cache fallback; `refresh()` → `ref.invalidateSelf()`.
- Lightweight shell UI state: `StateProvider` / `StateNotifierProvider` (`flutter_riverpod/legacy.dart`) is fine for tabs and similar.

## Navigation

- `MaterialApp`: `navigatorKey` from `NavigationService`, `onGenerateRoute`, string `initialRoute`.
- Central `generateRoute(RouteSettings)`; optional `Map` args for `PageRouteBuilder` transitions (match 24-connect router style as you grow).

## Cross-cutting

- `ProviderScope` at root; nested `ProviderScope(overrides: [...])` for `ScreenSizeScope` / responsive data.
- Secrets: `.env` + `flutter_dotenv` when backend is wired; list in `pubspec` assets if bundled.
- i18n: `easy_localization` + `assets/translations/` when you add locales.
- Theming: root `ThemeData`; brand tokens in `lib/src/data/constants/` (this app uses `colour_constants.dart` — keep tokens centralized).

## Do / Don’t

- **Do** keep API parsing and persistence in the data layer.
- **Do** use `*_provider.dart`, `*_service.dart`, `*_model.dart` naming.
- **Don’t** add `go_router` unless the team explicitly migrates.
- **Don’t** put HTTP clients or token storage inside `interfaces/`.
